<title>UK: Thermo Fibre Tek sets $100 mln 7-yr convertible.</title>
<headline>Thermo Fibre Tek sets $100 mln 7-yr convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following converbible bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Salomon.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THERMO FIBRE TEK</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THERMO ELECTRON CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON  ** 4.5-4.75  MATURITY    15.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    LUX	 IND PREM  **16-20 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES   ** INDICATED, TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A-/BAA3   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	THREE YEAR NO HARD CALL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
